.TH SET_ROBUST_LIST 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
set_robust_list \- Linux x86-64 syscall 273
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/syscall_260_299.h>
.B int set_robust_list(void* head, size_t length);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Registers a Linux robust-futex list for the calling thread.
This is a direct Linux x86-64 syscall wrapper; availability and permissions depend on the kernel and security policy.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set on failure.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR set_robust_list (2)
